OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe south
OL,6,Fwill continue mostly dry and frosty
OL,7,Fwith clear spells while blustery
OL,8,Fshowers, some wintry, continue in the
OL,9,Fnorth at times. North to northwest
OL,10,Fwinds increasing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCentral Belt and southwards
OL,13,Flargely dry with spells of weak winter
OL,14,Fsunshine. Over Argyll blustery showers
OL,15,Fat times, these wintry over high
OL,16,Fground. Northerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
